<title>UK: Britannia B/S sets 100 million stg bond.</title>
<headline>Britannia B/S sets 100 million stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BRITANNIA BUILDING SOCIETY</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY  *    SEP.11</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    30.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	**</p>
<p> NOTES    * CALL ON 02.OCT.06 AT PAR</p>
<p>	   ** TO BE PRICED 88 BP OVER 7.5 PCT 2006 GILT</p>
<p>		AND 188 BP OVER PREVAILING FIVE YEARS</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA1	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
